summary: Config iscsi disks for kdump test.
description: |
    Config iscsi devices. Support following args:

    1. TARGET_NAME:
    	The iscsi target name. The initiator name will be same as the TARGET_NAME.
    	By default it's iqn.2019-06.com.kdump:server0

    2. FS_TYPE:
    	Filesystem type the iscsi target will be formatted to.
    	Formatting is done on the client.
    	By default it's xfs

    3. MP:
    	Mount point on client for the iscsi/multipath device.
    	By default, it's /mnt/iscsi
contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
test: chmod a+x ./runtest.sh; ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
duration: 30m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/config-iscsi
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/config-iscsi
